\newlabel{tab:sens_wd_bri_shift}{{2}{2}{Signed $v_{50}$ shift (m/s) by BRI wind sub-score and composite score, capped at $\pm 12.0$~m/s. Positive shifts move the curve rightward (the building tolerates more wind before damage)}{table.2}{}}
